==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 63.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,900f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has very little threat. If one is worried about Metal Doge here, bring a fodder crit unit.

